msgid "Evening report"
msgstr "Kechki hisobot"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every workday evening, sum up the day in a few lines: how many tasks were "
"done and how many are late (name the late ones and whose they are), who came "
"to work late today, and today's sales at each pharmacy compared with the "
"same weekday last week. Put anything unusual first."
msgstr ""
"Har ish kuni kechqurun kunni bir necha qatorda xulosa qil: nechta vazifa "
"bajarildi va nechtasi kechikdi (kechikkanlarini va kimniki ekanini yoz), "
"bugun kim ishga kechikib keldi va har bir dorixonaning bugungi savdosi "
"o‘tgan haftaning shu kuniga nisbatan qanday. G‘ayrioddiy narsalarni birinchi "
"yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "Monday: the best of last week"
msgstr "Dushanba: o‘tgan haftaning eng yaxshilari"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every Monday morning: who did best last week (tasks done on time, coming to "
"work on time, and for cashiers their sales) and who needs help, with one or "
"two reasons for each. Name at most three people in each group."
msgstr ""
"Har dushanba ertalab: o‘tgan hafta kim eng yaxshi ishladi (vazifalarni o‘z "
"vaqtida bajarish, ishga o‘z vaqtida kelish, kassirlar uchun esa savdo) va "
"kimga yordam kerak, har biri uchun bir-ikki sabab bilan. Har guruhda ko‘pi "
"bilan uch kishini yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "Who is at work at 10:00"
msgstr "Ishda kim bor (soat 10:00)"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every workday at 10:00: who has not come to work yet, who came late today, "
"and which pharmacy is short of people right now. If everyone is in, say so "
"in one line."
msgstr ""
"Har ish kuni, soat 10:00: kim hali ishga kelmadi, bugun kim kechikib keldi "
"va hozir qaysi dorixonada odam yetishmayapti. Hamma joyida bo‘lsa, shuni bir "
"qatorda yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "Last week's biggest expenses"
msgstr "O‘tgan haftaning eng katta xarajatlari"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every Monday: last week's biggest expenses by category and the five largest "
"payments, compared with a usual week (the average of the four weeks before). "
"Say which expense grew the most, and by how much."
msgstr ""
"Har dushanba: o‘tgan haftaning toifalar bo‘yicha eng katta xarajatlari va "
"eng katta beshta to‘lov, odatdagi hafta bilan solishtirib (undan oldingi "
"to‘rt haftaning o‘rtachasi). Qaysi xarajat eng ko‘p o‘sganini va qanchaga "
"o‘sganini yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "The month in short"
msgstr "Oy qisqacha"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"On the 1st of each month: last month in short. Sales and profit, the biggest "
"expenses, how many tasks the team did on time, and what changed most from "
"the month before. Five to eight lines."
msgstr ""
"Har oyning 1-sanasida: o‘tgan oy qisqacha. Savdo va foyda, eng katta "
"xarajatlar, jamoa nechta vazifani o‘z vaqtida bajargani va undan oldingi "
"oyga nisbatan eng ko‘p nima o‘zgargani. Beshdan sakkiz qatorgacha."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "Documents expiring in 30 days"
msgstr "30 kun ichida muddati tugaydigan hujjatlar"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every Monday: the staff documents, certificates and contracts that expire in "
"the next 30 days or have already expired, whose they are and the date, the "
"most urgent first. If nothing expires, say so in one line."
msgstr ""
"Har dushanba: keyingi 30 kun ichida muddati tugaydigan yoki allaqachon "
"tugagan xodimlar hujjatlari, sertifikatlari va shartnomalari, kimniki ekani "
"va sanasi bilan, eng shoshilinchi birinchi. Hech narsaning muddati tugamasa, "
"shuni bir qatorda yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "A pharmacy sold less than usual"
msgstr "Odatdagidan kam sotgan dorixona"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every evening, compare today's sales at each pharmacy with its usual for "
"this weekday (the average of the last four same weekdays). Name every "
"pharmacy that sold more than 15 percent below its usual, with both numbers. "
"If all are as usual, say so in one line."
msgstr ""
"Har kuni kechqurun har bir dorixonaning bugungi savdosini shu hafta kunidagi "
"odatdagi savdosi bilan solishtir (oxirgi to‘rtta shunday kunning "
"o‘rtachasi). Odatdagidan 15 foizdan ko‘proq kam sotgan har bir dorixonani "
"ikkala raqam bilan yoz. Hammasi odatdagidek bo‘lsa, shuni bir qatorda yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid "Late work every morning"
msgstr "Har tong kechikkan ishlar"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/custom_templates.py
msgid ""
"Every workday at 9:00: the tasks that are late, grouped by person with the "
"oldest first, and who has the most. Say how many there are in all in the "
"first line."
msgstr ""
"Har ish kuni, soat 9:00: kechikkan vazifalar, kishilar bo‘yicha va eng "
"eskisi birinchi, hamda kimda eng ko‘p. Birinchi qatorda jami nechta ekanini "
"yoz."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
#, python-format
msgid "Every 30 minutes, %(start)s–%(end)s"
msgstr "Har 30 daqiqada, %(start)s–%(end)s"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
#, python-format
msgid "Tasks due in the next 24 hours: %(count)s"
msgstr "Keyingi 24 soatda muddati keladigan vazifalar: %(count)s"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "Deadline watcher"
msgstr "Muddat nazoratchisi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid ""
"Tells whoever gave a task when it is late, once, with a button to open it or "
"give an hour more. Never repeats what the reminders already said."
msgstr ""
"Vazifa kechiksa, uni bergan odamga bir marta xabar beradi: ochish yoki yana "
"bir soat berish tugmasi bilan. Eslatmalar aytganini takrorlamaydi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "Late by"
msgstr "Kechikish"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "How late a task is before its giver hears."
msgstr "Vazifa qancha kechiksa, bergan odamga xabar boradi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "hours"
msgstr "soat"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "Quiet from"
msgstr "Sokin vaqt boshlanishi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "Quiet until"
msgstr "Sokin vaqt tugashi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
msgid "Checks for late work"
msgstr "Kechikkan ishlarni tekshiradi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/deadline_watcher.py
#, python-format
msgid "Told %(to)s that «%(task)s» is late (%(assignee)s)"
msgstr "%(to)s xabardor qilindi: «%(task)s» kechikmoqda (%(assignee)s)"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Payroll check before pay day"
msgstr "Ish haqi kunidan oldin tekshirish"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Bonus suggestions"
msgstr "Bonus takliflari"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
#, python-format
msgid "Documents and contracts to watch: %(count)s"
msgstr "Kuzatiladigan hujjat va shartnomalar: %(count)s"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "HR assistant"
msgstr "HR yordamchisi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid ""
"Each workday morning HR hears what needs them: documents and contracts that "
"end, probations, explanations owed and birthdays. Before pay day it "
"calculates the payroll draft and says what holds it up; it can also suggest "
"bonuses for the best on-time work, for a person to approve."
msgstr ""
"Har ish kuni ertalab kadrlar bo‘limiga bugun nima kutayotganini aytadi: "
"muddati tugayotgan hujjat va shartnomalar, sinov muddatlari, kutilayotgan "
"tushuntirish xatlari va tug‘ilgan kunlar. Ish haqi kunidan oldin oylik "
"qoralamasini hisoblab, unga nima to‘sqinlik qilayotganini aytadi; "
"vazifalarni o‘z vaqtida eng yaxshi bajarganlarga bonus ham taklif qila "
"oladi, uni mas’ul xodim tasdiqlaydi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "The morning HR note"
msgstr "Ertalabki HR xati"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Payroll before pay day"
msgstr "Maosh kunidan oldin ish haqi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "A bonus reason"
msgstr "Mukofot sababi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
#: backend/apps/ai/agents/morning_plan.py
msgid "Send at"
msgstr "Yuborish vaqti"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid ""
"Last month's payroll draft is calculated and checked this many days before "
"pay day."
msgstr ""
"O‘tgan oyning ish haqi qoralamasi ish haqi kunidan shuncha kun oldin "
"hisoblanadi va tekshiriladi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "days"
msgstr "kun"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Point out pay changes over"
msgstr "Katta o‘zgarish chegarasi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Net pay that moved more than this against the month before."
msgstr ""
"Qo‘lga beriladigan summa o‘tgan oyga nisbatan bundan ko‘proq o‘zgarsa, bu "
"aytiladi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Suggest bonuses"
msgstr "Bonus taklif qilish"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid ""
"On the month's last workday, propose a bonus for the people with the best on-"
"time work. A person approves each one in Payroll."
msgstr ""
"Oyning oxirgi ish kunida vazifalarni o‘z vaqtida eng yaxshi bajarganlarga "
"bonus taklif qiladi. Har birini mas’ul xodim «Ish haqi» bo‘limida "
"tasdiqlaydi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "People to suggest"
msgstr "Taklif qilinadigan xodimlar"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "people"
msgstr "kishi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Bonus amount"
msgstr "Bonus miqdori"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Each suggested bonus, in the payroll's currency."
msgstr "Har bir taklif qilinadigan bonus, ish haqi valyutasida."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
msgid "Morning HR check"
msgstr "Ertalabki kadrlar tekshiruvi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/hr_assistant.py
#, python-format
msgid "HR digest for %(to)s: %(count)s item"
msgid_plural "HR digest for %(to)s: %(count)s items"
msgstr[0] "HR xulosasi (%(to)s): %(count)s ta masala"

