msgstr ""
"Ovozli xabar va yozma ko‘rsatmalarni vazifaga aylantiradi: kim uchun, "
"qachongacha, shoshilinchmi, rasm kerakmi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/voice_tasks.py
