#: owner_bot/ownerbot/bot_messages.py
msgid ""
"Here you create your company, confirm dashboard sign-ins and get approvals "
"and alerts from your business."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda kompaniyangizni yaratasiz, boshqaruv paneliga kirishni tasdiqlaysiz "
"hamda biznesingizdan tasdiqlash so‘rovlari va ogohlantirishlarni olasiz."

